      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Mechanical complete-set arbitrage only\n**BUY_COMPLETE_SET:** buy YES + NO when fee-adjusted total cost is below 1.  \n**SELL_COMPLETE_SET:** sell prefunded YES + NO when fee-adjusted proceeds exceed 1.  \n\nNo ML, no Binance signal, no momentum and no intentional holding period. The C++ evaluator runs on the existing Polymarket book hot path with **0 ms artificial delay**. `Locked PAPER Capacity` is a paired top-of-book simulation and is **pre-gas / pre-on-chain fixed cost**, so it is the right metric for whether the price dislocation exists, not a claim of realized cash PnL."
      }
